# The conversation record, written into the working directory by a server run from a
# checkout. Real call data, and a different file on every machine.
/conversations.jsonl

# Agent working state — session scratch and git worktrees, all of it machine-local.
# The worktrees are the reason this is not merely untidy: each carries its own .git
# file, so a `git add -A` commits a gitlink to a checkout that exists on one laptop.
/.claude/
